text:
The plate holds leftover avocado slices (about 3 small pieces), a bit of egg yolk, and pepper.

Avocado: roughly 50 g at about 1.6 kcal/g, so about 80 kcal. Egg yolk smears: about 5 g, so about 15 kcal. That gives about 95 kcal. Since the pieces are thin slivers, I'll lower the avocado estimate to about 40 g (64 kcal). Adding the yolk and some smeared residue brings the total to about 85 kcal over about 50 g.

{"kcal": 85, "mass_g": 50}
